# This is a pnpm workspace. `npm install` at the root resolves only the root
# devDependencies and links no workspace package, which leaves the daemon
# failing with "Cannot find package '@agentigram/p2p'" while looking installed.
# apps/tui keeps its own package-lock.json on purpose — it is a Bare/Pear app
# and installs with npm.
/package-lock.json
